
# Cache-Aside Pattern

## Overview

The Cache-Aside pattern is one of the most commonly used caching strategies.

The application is responsible for loading data into the cache.

## Read Flow

```text
Client
   |
Application
   |
Check Cache
   |
   +---- Hit ----> Return Data
   |
   +---- Miss
          |
       Database
          |
       Store in Cache
          |
       Return Data
